{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12378","headline":"过王舍人宅 · 钱起","name":"过王舍人宅","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"入门花柳暗，知是近臣居。\n大隐心何远，高风物自疎。\n翛然静者事，宛得上皇余。\n鸡犬偷仙药，儿童授道书。\n清吟送客後，微月上城初。\n彩笔有新咏，文星垂太虚。\n承恩金殿宿，应荐马相如。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12378.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12378","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}